===Noun===
{{en-noun|supercontinent]]

# a very large [[continent]] that [[split]] into smaller ones in the [[earth|Earth’s]] [[geologic]] past.
# sometimes used to refer, due to their being composed of multiple continents, one of the following modern landmasses: [[Eurasia]], [[Africa-Eurasia]], and sometimes the [[Americas]]. (cf. [[subcontinent]])

